This directory contains some sample scripts that can be used together
with the module FALSE of openmolcas. A possible application is, for
example, performing a geometry optimization with a method not currently
available in OpenMolcas:

  * At least one basis function is still needed
  &GATEWAY
    Coord = caffeine.xyz
    Basis = ANO-S...0s,O.ANO-S...1s
    Group = NoSym

  > do while

  * Two-electron integrals can be omitted
  &SEWARD
    OneInt

  &FALSE
    Run = $CurrDir/run_mopac.py

  &SLAPAF
    Kriging

  > end do

Sample scripts are available for the following programs:

* ORCA (https://www.faccts.de/orca)

* Gaussian (https://gaussian.com)

* MOPAC (https://openmopac.net)

* xTB (https://xtb-docs.readthedocs.io)

These scripts are intended as a starting point. You should review, test, and
adapt them to the specifics of your installation and the type of calculation
you wish to perform.
